#: ../../getting-started/index.md:1
msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Getting Started"

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:3
msgid "安装"
msgstr "Installation"

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:5
msgid "项目要求 Python 3.12 或更高（3.12 至 3.14），推荐用 `uv` 管理："
msgstr "The project requires Python 3.12 or newer (3.12 to 3.14) and recommends managing dependencies with `uv`:"

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:13
msgid "也可以先构建 wheel 再作为命令行工具安装："
msgstr "Alternatively, build a wheel and install it as a command-line tool:"

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:20
msgid "任何情况下，先运行 `magshield-env --help` 查看当前可用的命令、参数和示例；它是最新的命令细节来源。"
msgstr "In all cases, run `magshield-env --help` first to see the current commands, arguments, and examples; it is the most up-to-date source of command details."

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:22
msgid "第一次使用：TUI 五步向导"
msgstr "First use: the five-step TUI wizard"

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:28
msgid "全屏向导按五个步骤收集定义，最后给出校验报告，只有没有任何阻塞问题时才允许导出："
msgstr "The full-screen wizard collects the definition in five steps and shows a validation report before export; export is allowed only when there are no blocking issues:"

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:30
msgid "**采样区域**：生成笛卡尔盒、圆柱、球体或球面点集，或导入测量点集。"
msgstr "**Sampling region**: generate a Cartesian box, cylinder, sphere, or sphere-surface point set, or import a measured point set."

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:31
msgid "**正向模型**：三选一——固定响应矩阵、有限元逐通道场、或导体几何（动态 Biot-Savart）。"
msgstr "**Forward model**: choose exactly one of a fixed response matrix, per-channel finite-element fields, or conductor geometry (dynamic Biot-Savart)."

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:32
msgid "**硬件**：声明每个通道的电流边界、爬升率、电阻和电压限制，以及控制器步长。"
msgstr "**Hardware**: declare per-channel current bounds, slew rate, resistance, voltage limits, and the controller timestep."

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:33
msgid "**场景**：声明静态外部场与位姿，或绑定 HDF5 轨迹。"
msgstr "**Scenario**: declare a static external field and pose, or bind an HDF5 trajectory."

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:34
msgid "**环境行为**：选择观测模式、是否包含位姿、非法动作行为与奖励参数。"
msgstr "**Environment behavior**: choose the observation mode, whether to include pose, the illegal-action behavior, and reward parameters."

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:36
msgid "三分钟跑通一个例子"
msgstr "Run a complete example in three minutes"

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:38
msgid "仓库自带一个完整的最小构建定义 `examples/minimal-finite-element/build.yaml`（两点、两通道的有限元 CSV 场）。复制它到一个新目录，把 `output_dir` 改成新路径，然后："
msgstr "The repository ships a complete minimal build definition at `examples/minimal-finite-element/build.yaml` (two points, two finite-element CSV channels). Copy it to a new directory, change `output_dir`, then:"

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:45
msgid "程序化构建和加载见[教程：用 build.yaml 与 Python API 构建](../tutorials/programmatic-build)。"
msgstr "For programmatic construction and loading, see [Tutorial: building with build.yaml and the Python API](../tutorials/programmatic-build)."

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:47
msgid "加载环境包"
msgstr "Load an environment package"

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:49
msgid "导出的目录不依赖任何原始源文件，直接通过 Gymnasium 接口加载："
msgstr "The exported directory does not depend on any original source files; load it directly through the Gymnasium interface:"

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:63
msgid "下一步"
msgstr "Next steps"

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:65
msgid "想跟着向导走完整流程：[用 TUI 构建第一个环境](../tutorials/tui-first-env)。"
msgstr "Follow the full wizard flow: [Tutorial: build your first environment with the TUI](../tutorials/tui-first-env)."

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:66
msgid "想理解每个概念的物理含义：[概念](../concepts/units-and-formats)。"
msgstr "Understand the physical meaning of each concept: [Concepts](../concepts/units-and-formats)."

#: ../../getting-started/index.md:67
msgid "遇到校验失败：[操作指南：排查](../how-to/troubleshooting)。"
msgstr "Facing a failed validation: [How-to: troubleshooting](../how-to/troubleshooting)."
